{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0563_1000_p", "source_sha256": "896c158454a836545e0e6392a9730d6755bf9d4eeacf11668fec3078a5626d2c", "ja": "（今日は『好奇心∞無限大！』の本番当日。\n代表して、ひなたがお昼の生放送で番組をPRする）", "zh": "（今天是《好奇心∞无限大！》的正式录制日。由日向代表，在午间直播节目中为节目做宣传。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0563_1001_035hin", "source_sha256": "898c6f9e3d2cda4f6b0584ef5ded0d9ad9981ec2dd2fefe4b2fc8cd349b1c2c3", "ja": "あたしと可奈ちゃん、紬さんのプレゼン対決です。\nそれぞれの地元に、取材にも行ったりして……。", "zh": "这是我、可奈，还有紬小姐之间的企划对决。  \n我们还分别去了各自的家乡进行采访……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0563_1002_035hin", "source_sha256": "0880ae3a1953b87693cf81a5eda65774efd74050ed1f6ec6117fa6c57285983f", "ja": "色んなことをたくさん知れて、なまら楽しかったです！\n本番も、よかったら観てくださいねぇ！", "zh": "了解了好多好多有趣的事情，特别开心！正式播出的时候，也请大家有空一定要看看哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0563_1003_p", "source_sha256": "44a462f5382f453daa5ad9cec9f999d2d25ede4d09e3cbc78e57fb8417732e5c", "ja": "お疲れ様、ひなた！　いいPRだったよ。\n番組に興味を持ってくれる人もいるんじゃないかな。", "zh": "辛苦了，日向！这次宣传做得很好。\n应该会有人因此对节目产生兴趣吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0563_1004_035hin", "source_sha256": "1edf8e506b9e3d57cf51bf6a6746253f7d819c04c8c4e6a1cac704032ed8da97", "ja": "本当かい？　えへへ……{$P$}が\nそう言うなら、大丈夫な気がしてきたよぉ。", "zh": "真的吗？嘿嘿……既然{$P$}这么说，我也觉得应该没问题了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0563_1005_035hin", "source_sha256": "70f5bf4c06660ae4f45be6011e81a7f12e61d7d7b4f842533afb8b999302cd86", "ja": "あたしも、家にいたころよく見てたんだわ。\n農作業のお昼休みに、いつもテレビから流れててね。", "zh": "我在家里的时候也经常看呢。\n农忙时的午休时间，电视里总是会播放。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0563_1006_p", "source_sha256": "daf331dfc5027f1cbbde8cac019072af5ebe18fe07f53aa66167174aaec8ad6a", "ja": "そうだったのか。\nなら、ひなたのご家族にも馴染みがあるんだな。", "zh": "原来是这样。那ひなた的家人也很熟悉这个节目啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0563_1007_035hin", "source_sha256": "297a5e6738209454b453ed9cc3a1d0bffe07aaabb0c8429734a4811be3cc873a", "ja": "うん！　あたしがこの番組に出るって聞いて、\nみんな喜んでくれたよぉ。", "zh": "嗯！听说我要参加这个节目，大家都替我高兴呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0563_1008_035hin", "source_sha256": "480fb3f6411b56a325a3bc7661bfd94ff6330a49bfbfeb7698acc68193f0acc8", "ja": "遠いから、なかなか会いには行けないけども……\n仕事をしてたら、あたしの顔は見てもらえるしねぇ。", "zh": "虽然离得远，不太能去见他们……不过只要我工作，他们就能看到我的脸嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0563_1009_p", "source_sha256": "30719d9d74d692eb1d111f1c655ba01dfb89d607c6db7b86fa2ab0fa2deeadc7", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。ひなたが元気に頑張ってる姿で、\nご家族はもちろん安心するだろうし……。", "zh": "啊，说得也是。看到日向精神满满地努力着的样子，家人肯定也会放心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0563_1010_p", "source_sha256": "81ecddceb05c3701fcbbbb7b471512b68b82d672df3037c66e79705a7e5e0f09", "ja": "そんなひなたを見ている人達も、きっと\n元気をもらってると思うよ！", "zh": "我觉得，看到这样的日向，大家也一定都能从她身上得到活力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0563_1011_035hin", "source_sha256": "370b06b42ce7f7fd4f817639398b5f364f21b3252a6db8e4ea0eb6582b8f4fd3", "ja": "{$P$}……えへへ。\nうん、そうだといいねぇ。", "zh": "{$P$}……嘿嘿。\n嗯，要是那样就好了呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0563_1012_035hin", "source_sha256": "9191ab7bce0e9d46f426a91ae0a42ad3db7972272c0ca13d35e3b6c64e5f5bbd", "ja": "本当はね、あたしの地元の話も、ちょっこし\nしようかなって考えたんだけども……。", "zh": "其实呢，我本来还想着，要不要稍微聊聊我家乡的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0563_1013_035hin", "source_sha256": "a6c48afe2ca589146caf5ef2468e3ac7248f4d556df9a00b34acde2205f025a6", "ja": "でも、BOTは真剣勝負だからねぇ。あたしだけ\n自分の地元の話をするのは、フェアじゃないべさ。", "zh": "不过，BOT可是要认真较量的嘛。只有我一个人说自己家乡的事，那可不公平呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0563_1014_p", "source_sha256": "693d532727e8c64f2a30b1e1baaf3d5184fa7463fedadad9a32bcac3941773ad", "ja": "そうだったのか。\n……偉いな、ひなたは。", "zh": "原来是这样啊。\n……你很了不起，日向。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0563_1015_035hin", "source_sha256": "57bd62af9197d9b673bf7f6e1a218fb2ae48a8a1f2978dd7ae42ab7ca688cbbf", "ja": "なんも。あたしがみんなと、\n正々堂々勝負したかっただけだからねぇ。", "zh": "没啥。我只是想和大家堂堂正正地较量而已呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0563_1016_p", "source_sha256": "7afbe1e5297a1b964c621e609ee01ec73317722a424853260993d549f363086b", "ja": "うん、そうだな。\nこのまま、本番も頑張れそうか？", "zh": "嗯，是啊。\n保持这个状态，正式演出也能加油冲一把吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0563_1017_035hin", "source_sha256": "3c4af432f2005b656507a64707ea1b577c89cb150b47b2a04490389674c4527b", "ja": "もちろんだよぉ。あたしたちの地元の魅力が\nみんなに伝わるように、がんばるべさ！", "zh": "当然啦。我会加油，让大家都能感受到我们家乡的魅力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
